.SH NAME
lmm-game-clear-default - Clear the default game setting


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlmm game clear-default [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the default game setting.

.PP
Every command that needs a game (install, search, list, and so on) then
requires an explicit --game/-g flag until a new default is set.

.PP
Examples:
  lmm game clear-default


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for clear-default


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
